            // Serializing changes per select keeps `connectedValue` meaningful: overlapping
            // requests could revert to a value a later, successful change had already moved
            // past, and would race each other's writes to the per-instance adapter
            // bookkeeping the server keeps.
            $select.prop("disabled", true);
