                    // a transport drop, or a framework result like access-denied — so there is no
                    // server message to read and jqXhr.responseJSON would be undefined. Without
                    // the alert the dropdown would snap back with no explanation and read as
                    // broken. Cleared before the alert because alert blocks: the other way round
